                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Great to meet with the Fire Chiefs Association of Massachusetts today in Washington, DC to discuss the importance of FIRE and SAFER grant funding and the funding of our hospitals and medical centers to protect EMTs, doctors and nurses, and patients. \n\nSpecial thanks to my friend, retired Chief Bill Scoble of @westwoodfire, Retired Chief Gene Doherty of Revere, and the chiefs of the 8th Congressional District in attendance: Chief Brian Nardelli of @Brockton_Fire, Chief Keith Stark of @WEYMOUTHFIRE, Chief Michael Carroll of @Stofirerescue, Chief Luke McFadden of Holbrook, Chief Justin Alexander of @EastonFire, Chief Steven Lund of Westwood, and retired Chief Kevin Partridge of Easton. We are grateful for their hard work and service!",
